  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Construction and infrastructural works&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Upgrading of existing infrastructure and the construction of new basic infrastructure to serve 204 new low-income households including infrastructural earthworks, extension of the existing sewer network and house connections, access roads (asphalt/brick pavements), public street lighting, sport facilities, a multifunctional and child care centre and landscaping.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
